== C3 W a2 a3 b2 / B b7 c6 c7 (default: count rule, e.p. on, aware test); value *2; nimber check *2: True
  W01  W: a2 a3 b3 / B: b7 c6 c7
       value: {{{⇑* | 0, *} | 0} | 0}   outcome R
  W02  W: a2 a3 b4 / B: b7 c6 c7 (ep b3) [double step: e.p. right for the opponent]
       value: {{⇑* | 0, *} | 0}   outcome R
  W03  W: a2 a4 b2 / B: b7 c6 c7
       value: {0 | {*, {+W | {0 | ⇓*}} | -2}, {0 | {0 | ⇓*}}}   outcome L
  B01  W: a2 a3 b2 / B: b6 c6 c7
       value: {0 | {0 | {0, * | ⇓*}}}   outcome L
  B02  W: a2 a3 b2 / B: b5 c6 c7 (ep b6) [double step: e.p. right for the opponent]
       value: {0 | {0, * | ⇓*}}   outcome L
  B03  W: a2 a3 b2 / B: b7 c5 c7
       value: {{2 | *, {{⇑* | 0} | -W}}, {{⇑* | 0} | 0} | 0}   outcome R

